(7689247, 1259816, 4008, '<td valign="top">Northern lights, always gorgeous. And in this one you have a nice spread across the image with a great silhouette of the mountains, plus the reflection in the lake. A beauty. (small point: strange however that I see only one light spot in the lake, I would clone it out or soften it)</td>', 'Northern lights, always gorgeous. And in this one you have a nice spread across the image with a great silhouette of the mountains, plus the reflection in the lake. A beauty. (small point: strange however that I see only one light spot in the lake, I would clone it out or soften it)', '2021-03-11 04:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
