(7689595, 1259410, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful greens, blues, slash of red, rust and tawny.  Fine eye for color. Superior composition.  Nice wavy, swirly lines.  The ropes holding the boat impart the ease of a hammock on a lazy summer day.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful greens, blues, slash of red, rust and tawny.  Fine eye for color. Superior composition.  Nice wavy, swirly lines.  The ropes holding the boat impart the ease of a hammock on a lazy summer day.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-03-16 21:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689596, 1259816, 173844, '<td valign="top">Like a world soaked in greens.  Spectacularly flamboyant, the stars, the reflections, the angled beach and mountains.  A precious gift from the north.  On top of all that, the brighter tones form a star, too.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Like a world soaked in greens.  Spectacularly flamboyant, the stars, the reflections, the angled beach and mountains.  A precious gift from the north.  On top of all that, the brighter tones form a star, too.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2021-03-16 21:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689597, 1259750, 173844, '<td valign="top">That insect is really something, its emerald eyes drooping outward like molten tears.  The plate, or on whatever it''s alit, is just as fascinating, arced and afloat with a delightful array of greens.  The honeyed background nicely sets it all off.</td>', 'That insect is really something, its emerald eyes drooping outward like molten tears.  The plate, or on whatever it''s alit, is just as fascinating, arced and afloat with a delightful array of greens.  The honeyed background nicely sets it all off.', '2021-03-16 22:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689598, 1259466, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine, mysterious, sensual study.  That rich green on dark, against subtly grained wood, works well.  I like how the light that encompasses her contrasts with the inky stairwell.  Is she dreaming?  Is this a dream?  The perspective from overhead is the cherry on the artistry.</td>', 'Fine, mysterious, sensual study.  That rich green on dark, against subtly grained wood, works well.  I like how the light that encompasses her contrasts with the inky stairwell.  Is she dreaming?  Is this a dream?  The perspective from overhead is the cherry on the artistry.', '2021-03-16 22:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689599, 1259647, 173844, '<td valign="top">Love this guy''s expression, anthropomorphically speaking.  It''s a perfect pose. The rich, swampy green is finely set off against the minty background.  I like the curves of the cup and those on the frog, which subtly play off each other.  The beautiful copper eyes and highlights are all that more.</td>', 'Love this guy''s expression, anthropomorphically speaking.  It''s a perfect pose. The rich, swampy green is finely set off against the minty background.  I like the curves of the cup and those on the frog, which subtly play off each other.  The beautiful copper eyes and highlights are all that more.', '2021-03-16 22:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689600, 1259855, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simple, balanced composition.  Just that flash of green against the blue sky is enough.  Full in its minimalism.</td>', 'Simple, balanced composition.  Just that flash of green against the blue sky is enough.  Full in its minimalism.', '2021-03-16 22:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689602, 1259820, 173844, '<td valign="top">This lovely aurora seems somehow wistful to me, arising as it does at the end of the road.  The curved continuity of lines is very satisfying.  The darkness, peaceful.  The sheerness of the outer greens is lovely.</td>', 'This lovely aurora seems somehow wistful to me, arising as it does at the end of the road.  The curved continuity of lines is very satisfying.  The darkness, peaceful.  The sheerness of the outer greens is lovely.', '2021-03-16 22:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689603, 1259586, 173844, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know how to approach this image, but am taken by its overwhelming energy and the quirkiness of the people in the frames.  Oh, and the green greeniness of it.</td>', 'I didn''t know how to approach this image, but am taken by its overwhelming energy and the quirkiness of the people in the frames.  Oh, and the green greeniness of it.', '2021-03-16 22:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689604, 1259823, 173844, '<td valign="top">The textures of the overlapping feathers set up the lovely greens.  They seem modest, almost shyly approaching deeper saturation, yet still holding back.  They''re lovely, demure and enticing for all that.</td>', 'The textures of the overlapping feathers set up the lovely greens.  They seem modest, almost shyly approaching deeper saturation, yet still holding back.  They''re lovely, demure and enticing for all that.', '2021-03-16 22:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689607, 1259694, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful array of greens.  Very Monet.  But the vegetation has kept my rating low.</td>', 'Beautiful array of greens.  Very Monet.  But the vegetation has kept my rating low.', '2021-03-16 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7689610, 1259459, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph, but because of the foliage in the background I lowered my rating.</td>', 'I love this photograph, but because of the foliage in the background I lowered my rating.', '2021-03-17 00:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689611, 1259586, 173844, '<td valign="top">Willem has a point.  I didn''t think of that.</td>', 'Willem has a point.  I didn''t think of that.', '2021-03-17 00:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689612, 1259410, 67145, '<td valign="top">i love this so much .. its a piece of art .. the interesting old boat and the patterns and reflections in the water .. this would great printed and hanging on a wall .. perfect for the challenge as well .. congrats on the 4th place .. :)</td>', 'i love this so much .. its a piece of art .. the interesting old boat and the patterns and reflections in the water .. this would great printed and hanging on a wall .. perfect for the challenge as well .. congrats on the 4th place .. :)', '2021-03-17 00:42:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689613, 1259647, 67145, '<td valign="top">what a fantastic shot .. and so great for the challenge .. <br/>and 16 years ago .. you must have a great filing system .. !! .. <br/>i''ve had a brief look thru this challenge after rollover and noticed that so many great and appropriate entries have received lots of very low votes .. when i say low i mean under 5 .. extremely disheartening .. doesnt bode well for dpc when ppl are so harsh .. and i feel without real cause .. even accounting for taste . <br/>just my 2 cents worth .. <br/>anyway .. i''m glad that this did well for you .. thankyou to that little frog for being such a great model .. not just for you .. but for anyone who sees this pic .. he looks very chill and almost thoughtful .. !! .. :)</td>', 'what a fantastic shot .. and so great for the challenge .. and 16 years ago .. you must have a great filing system .. !! .. i''ve had a brief look thru this challenge after rollover and noticed that so many great and appropriate entries have received lots of very low votes .. when i say low i mean under 5 .. extremely disheartening .. doesnt bode well for dpc when ppl are so harsh .. and i feel without real cause .. even accounting for taste . just my 2 cents worth .. anyway .. i''m glad that this did well for you .. thankyou to that little frog for being such a great model .. not just for you .. but for anyone who sees this pic .. he looks very chill and almost thoughtful .. !! .. :)', '2021-03-17 00:47:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689614, 1259816, 67145, '<td valign="top">this such a stunning scene .. congrats on your blue ribbon .. <br/>for someone living in rural australia this looks otherworldly .. :)</td>', 'this such a stunning scene .. congrats on your blue ribbon .. for someone living in rural australia this looks otherworldly .. :)', '2021-03-17 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689615, 1259459, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> I love this photograph, but because of the foliage in the background I lowered my rating. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha, thanks for your honesty, I had a feeling that could be the case but I took the risk.</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: I love this photograph, but because of the foliage in the background I lowered my rating.   Ha, thanks for your honesty, I had a feeling that could be the case but I took the risk.', '2021-03-17 00:50:07.000000', NULL, 0),
