(7689617, 1259820, 67145, '<td valign="top">you have the most amazing skies in iceland  .. if i lived there i dont think i''d ever get tired of photographing them .. <br/>i can imagine you would get the most wonderful variations as well ..<br/>congrats on the ribbon .. :)</td>', 'you have the most amazing skies in iceland  .. if i lived there i dont think i''d ever get tired of photographing them .. i can imagine you would get the most wonderful variations as well ..congrats on the ribbon .. :)', '2021-03-17 00:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
