(7689620, 1259586, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i> I am not rating this high since to me this seems to be an image of someone else''s artwork. </i></td></tr></table> If I were a religious person, I could say that anything we shoot is Someone else''s artwork :). Really, when we shoot a beautiful landscape, can we really take credit for it? In my defense, some details in this images is mine: framing, my friend and me in the openings, exposition, processing. In other words, about as much creative work as in a typical landscape photo :)</td>', 'Originally posted by willem: I am not rating this high since to me this seems to be an image of someone else''s artwork.  If I were a religious person, I could say that anything we shoot is Someone else''s artwork :). Really, when we shoot a beautiful landscape, can we really take credit for it? In my defense, some details in this images is mine: framing, my friend and me in the openings, exposition, processing. In other words, about as much creative work as in a typical landscape photo :)', '2021-03-17 02:18:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689622, 1259466, 20608, '<td valign="top">Brilliant</td>', 'Brilliant', '2021-03-17 03:39:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689623, 1259822, 55281, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all who voted for my entry - your votes are appreciated :)     I was avoiding plants (as in the rules) but did not think fruit would be on that list - even though obviously part of a plant!  Anyway, it was too late to withdraw so lesson learned for futures!</td>', 'Thank you to all who voted for my entry - your votes are appreciated :)     I was avoiding plants (as in the rules) but did not think fruit would be on that list - even though obviously part of a plant!  Anyway, it was too late to withdraw so lesson learned for futures!', '2021-03-17 04:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7689629, 1259586, 4008, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i> I am not rating this high since to me this seems to be an image of someone else''s artwork. </i></td></tr></table> If I were a religious person, I could say that anything we shoot is Someone else''s artwork :). Really, when we shoot a beautiful landscape, can we really take credit for it? In my defense, some details in this images is mine: framing, my friend and me in the openings, exposition, processing. In other words, about as much creative work as in a typical landscape photo :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I did also take into account that the framing of the persons was your addition.</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Originally posted by willem: I am not rating this high since to me this seems to be an image of someone else''s artwork.  If I were a religious person, I could say that anything we shoot is Someone else''s artwork :). Really, when we shoot a beautiful landscape, can we really take credit for it? In my defense, some details in this images is mine: framing, my friend and me in the openings, exposition, processing. In other words, about as much creative work as in a typical landscape photo :)  I did also take into account that the framing of the persons was your addition.', '2021-03-17 08:27:01.000000', NULL, 0),
